The five 68000 binaries a standalone build contains.

The Maven build writes them here, as it writes them into the classes the
jar is made of, so a Go executable built after it needs neither this
repository nor an assembler beside it.

A tree built without them does not contain one, and Read then gives nil
back: doc/BINARIES.md says what each of them is, and YMXR_68K names a
directory to read them from instead.
